        "value": "外込高 新田改出高 百九十八石三斗七合八勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Yield recorded outside the base assessment (外込高), specified as newly reclaimed land brought back onto the register by re-survey (新田改出高): 198.3078 koku — barely 1.5 percent of the 13,000-koku base. The entry wraps across two printed columns: label and sub-label in the right column, the figure in the next column to the left. The 升 place is skipped (石→斗→合→勺), so the reading is 198 + 0.3 + 0.007 + 0.0008."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
